{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-04_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-04","title":"企鵝物流","storyCode":"2-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"eb382678887edae9a235c7ccaedbb59282956e4fff188bdda95d708b6e4d6621","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"清理完畢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"確實......這群感染者，準備得還真是挺齊全的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也走快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......究竟是什麼人......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，請加快速度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們的身後有追兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"來得及反擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時不要吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我最好甩開他們，避免無謂的戰鬥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"先不說安全問題了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一條能最快離開貧民區，和陳長官會合的路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動，已經發現了我們的蹤跡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在路上花費的時間越多，羅德島的處境越危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"這好辦，我這有一條敵人想不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經有主意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"當然~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不過要說可不可靠，我還得親自去踩點看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"請加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"好喔~那我先去，馬上就回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"有事，就請聯繫另一位企鵝物流的專員！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以問問——我們要去哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會與近衛局會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門近衛局會負責保護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門近衛局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在的任務，是把你安全地移交給近衛局，由他們進行暫時的保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我差點就以為，你們真的是來救我的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們真的是來救你的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們原本準備直接向龍門要求接收部分感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是近衛局在聽到我們的彙報之後，突然要求羅德島將米莎小姐你移交給他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"況且......在龍門，近衛局對你的保護，將是最安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們不行動，你就會遭遇更大的危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"許多嘗試搶奪你的感染者，身上都戴著整合運動的標誌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道什麼整合運動......我記不清......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道近衛局，也看到過近衛局怎麼對待感染者。如果你們真的只是想抓我的話，直說不就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，但......我們並不是這樣想的。有些誤會現在還沒法解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你覺得我們有多惡劣——抱歉......請你先忍耐一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"比起你的心情，還是你的安全更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有機會，我會解釋一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"並且有些事情，我也想知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
